stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> PENDING_APPROVAL: task submitted
    PENDING_APPROVAL --> APPROVED: admin approves
    PENDING_APPROVAL --> CANCELLED: rejected or cancelled
    APPROVED --> OFFERING: task made available
    OFFERING --> CUSTOMER_SELECTED: customer selects an offer
    CUSTOMER_SELECTED --> TASKER_ACCEPTED: provider accepts
    TASKER_ACCEPTED --> READY_TO_START: prerequisites satisfied
    READY_TO_START --> IN_PROGRESS: work starts
    IN_PROGRESS --> COMPLETED: work completed
    APPROVED --> CANCELLED
    OFFERING --> CANCELLED
    CUSTOMER_SELECTED --> CANCELLED
    TASKER_ACCEPTED --> CANCELLED
    READY_TO_START --> CANCELLED
    IN_PROGRESS --> FAILED: work cannot be completed
    COMPLETED --> [*]
    CANCELLED --> [*]
    FAILED --> [*]
